cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "french-childes: a pipeline for tagging, parsing and syntactic coding of CHILDES data"
abstract: >-
  Python tools for converting CHILDES CHAT files into tabular (CSV) and CoNLL-U
  format, including tokenisation, POS tagging with TreeTagger, dependency
  parsing via the UDPipe API, graph rewriting and syntactic coding with Grew
  queries. Developed for French, but also used for Italian, German and English.
type: software
